4 KM |\n\nLandmark\n\nDistance / Connectivity\n\nHanging Gardens\n\n2.6 KM\n\nGovernor's Estate\n\n1.9 KM\n\nShree Babulnath Mandir\n\n1.4 KM\n\nMarine Drive\n\n0.5 KM\n\nNariman Point\n\n5.4 KM\n\nCSMT Railway Station\n\n4.4 KM\n\nConnectivity is based on the official project information and location context.\n\n### A Prestigious South Mumbai Address [...] ### Nearby Landmarks\n\n|  |  |\n --- |\n| Landmark | Distance / Connectivity |\n| Hanging Gardens | 2.6 KM |\n| Governor's Estate | 1.9 KM |\n| Shree Babulnath Mandir | 1.4 KM |\n| Marine Drive | 0.5 KM |\n| Nariman Point | 5.4 KM |\n| CSMT Railway Station | 4.4 KM |\n\nConnectivity is based on the official project information and location context.\n\n### A Prestigious South Mumbai Address\n\nMalabar Hill has long been recognized as one of Mumbai's most distinguished residential neighborhoods. Its combination of heritage, greenery, sea frontage, and limited residential supply has made it one of the city's most sought-after luxury destinations. Lodha Malabar further strengthens this legacy by occupying one of the largest residential land parcels in the locality.\n\n### Excellent Connectivity [...] ### Where is Lodha Malabar located?\n\nLodha Malabar is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai, on Walkeshwar Road in Malabar Hill, Mumbai. The project overlooks the Arabian Sea and Hanging Gardens while enjoying connectivity to Gopi Birla Memorial School, Malabar Hill, Wilson College, Kamathipura, Walkeshwar Temple, Malabar Hill.\n\n### What makes Lodha Malabar unique?\n\nThe project combines a landmark Malabar Hill address, contemporary Art Deco-inspired architecture, panoramic sea views, Club Saint Amand, and personalized hospitality services to create an exclusive luxury residential experience.\n\n### What amenities are available at Lodha Malabar?","score":0.8615995623478038,"raw_content":null,"id":"05cb82-04"},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/maharera-project/lodha-malabar/P51900034949","title":"Lodha Malabar, Walkeshwar Mumbai — Price, Possession & RERA | MPE","content":"Lodha Malabar, located in the prestigious Walkeshwar area of South Mumbai, redefines opulent living. This iconic residential development combines contemporary architecture with timeless elegance, offering discerning homeowners an address synonymous with luxury and exclusivity.\n\n### \\\\Prime Location\\\\\n\nSituated at Walkeshwar, one of Mumbai's most sought-after locales, Lodha Malabar boasts stunning views of the Arabian Sea and easy access to key landmarks like Marine Drive, the Hanging Gardens, and the Jain Temples. Its proximity to South Mumbai's business districts and cultural hubs makes it an ideal choice for high-profile professionals and families alike.\n\n### \\\\Exquisite Residences\\\\ [...] ### \\\\Exquisite Residences\\\\\n\nEach residence at Lodha Malabar is meticulously crafted to provide unparalleled comfort and style. Spacious layouts, high ceilings, and floor-to-ceiling windows invite natural light while offering breathtaking views of the city skyline and the ocean. Premium fittings, imported marble flooring, and thoughtfully designed interiors reflect a seamless blend of luxury and functionality.\n\n### \\\\World-Class Amenities\\\\\n\nResidents can indulge in a host of world-class amenities, including:\n\n- A state-of-the-art fitness center\n\n- Infinity-edge swimming pool with panoramic sea views\n\n- Lavish clubhouse for social gatherings\n\n- Landscaped gardens for tranquil evenings\n\n- Concierge services to cater to every need\n\n### \\\\Secure and Private\\\\ [...] Staircases, Lifts Wells and Lobbies at each Floor level Overhead and Underground Water Tanks20%\n\nStilt Floor 0%\n\n10\n\n## Amenities\n\nSwimming PoolKids Play AreaGardenClubhouseIndoor GamesMultipurpose HallGymnasiumJogging TrackYoga RoomSpaCCTV24x7 SecurityVideo Door PhoneFire SafetyIntercomAC LiftsPower BackupWater HarvestingParkingVisitor ParkingModular KitchenConcealed WiringConcealed Plumbing\n\n12\n\n## 